    "content": "Initial candidate implementation and validation are ready for peer review.\n\n- Added `VarsWithSources.__ror__`, so `dict | VarsWithSources` returns a dict with right-hand precedence.\n- Added regression coverage for both the direct union and `combine_vars` under replace behavior.\n- Validated with `python -m pytest test/units/utils/test_vars.py test/units/vars/test_variable_manager.py`.\n- Confirmed `candidate.patch` applies cleanly to a clean worktree at `f7234968d241d7171aadb1e873a67510753f3163`.\n\n```text\ncollected 25 items\n\ntest/units/utils/test_vars.py .................                          [ 68%]\ntest/units/vars/test_variable_manager.py ........                         [100%]\n\n============================== 25 passed in 0.49s ==============================\n```",
